//media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/027.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 27: The SVM Cost Function\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 27/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>The SVM Cost Function<br>27</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/028.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 28: The SVM Cost Function\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 28/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>The SVM Cost Function<br>28</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/029.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 29: The SVM Cost Function\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 29/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>The SVM Cost Function<br>29</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/030.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 30: Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 30/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs<br>30</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/031.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 31: Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 31/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs<br>31</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/032.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 32: Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 32/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs<br>32</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/033.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 33: Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 33/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs<br>33</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/034.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 34: Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 34/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Outlier Sensitivity in SVMs<br>34</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/035.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 35: Regularization in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 35/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Regularization in SVMs<br>35</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/036.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 36: Regularization in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 36/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Regularization in SVMs<br>36</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/037.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 37: Regularization in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 37/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Regularization in SVMs<br>37</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/038.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 38: Regularization in SVMs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 38/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Regularization in SVMs<br>38</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/039.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 39: Interpretation of SVM Coefficients\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 39/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Interpretation of SVM Coefficients<br>39</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/040.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 40: Linear SVM: The Syntax\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 40/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Linear SVM: The Syntax<br>40</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/041.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 41: Summary\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 41/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Summary<br>The main idea behind Support Vector Machines is to find a hyperplane that separates classes by determining decision boundaries that maximize the distance between classes.<br>When comparing logistic regression and SVMs, one of the main differences is that the cost function for logistic regression has a cost function that decreases to zero, but rarely reaches zero. SVMs use the Hinge Loss function as a cost function to penalize misclassification. This tends to lead to better accuracy at the cost of having less sensitivity on the predicted probabilities.<br>Regularization can help SVMs generalize better with future data.<br>41</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/AIL303m/flm1/d17/042.webp\" alt=\"AIL303m · 3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 42: Learning Recap\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3.3.1. Support Vector Machines · slide 42/42</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Learning Recap<br>In this section, we discussed:<br>- Support Vector Machines (SVM) approach to Classification<br>- Comparing SVM and Logistic Regression<br>- The SVM cost function<br>- Regularization in SVM models<br>42</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
